# The due-date prompt stays open when another program changes an unrelated line, so the date typed next is set on the block.
# BUG: a silent reload closes the date prompt, and the date typed next runs as navigate commands; Quick Add stays open across a reload (editing.md §6), file-io.md §3 is silent on prompts.
file <<END
INBOX:
	- Call the plumber
Home:
	- Fix the shelf
END
keys j md
see Due date
outside <<END
INBOX:
	- Call the plumber
Home:
	- Fix the big shelf
END
see Fix the big shelf
type tomorrow
keys <Enter>
quit
saved <<END
INBOX:
	- Call the plumber @due({today+1})
Home:
	- Fix the big shelf
END
